# Revisions  :
# Date        Version  Author   Description
# 2021-10-26  1.0.0    mrosiere math_pkg   : Created
#                               pbi_pkg    : Created
# 2025-01-11  1.1.0    mrosiere pbi_pkg    : Surcharge and / or
# 2025-03-08  1.2.0    mrosiere pbi_pkg    : Use unconstrainted pbi
# 2025-03-19  1.3.0    mrosiere logic_pkg  : Created
#                               string_pkg : Created
# 2025-03-26  1.4.0    mrosiere pbi_pkg    : Add type for unconstrainted array
# 2025-04-05  1.5.0    mrosiere convert_pkg: Add convertion one hot to  integer
# 2025-11-22  1.5.1    mrosiere sbi_pkg    : Add sbi pkg (replace pbi busy with ready)
# 2025-11-29  1.5.2    mrosiere logic_pkg  : Add mux2 and reverse_bits
# 2025-12-06  1.5.3    mrosiere logic_pkg  : override mux2 for natural
# 2025-12-30  1.6.0    mrosiere IEEE_dummy : add fake vital
# 2026-01-18  1.6.1    mrosiere sbi_pkg    : Add info record
# 2026-06-05  1.6.2    mrosiere convert_pkg: Add to_slv function
# 2026-06-16  1.6.3    mrosiere sbi_pkg    : Add null function
#                               logic_pkg  : Add count_ones
